@startuml
title N04 - Node lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "N04\nNode lifecycle" as N04
interface "LifecycleService::apply(); open_service_window(); service_window_open()" as API
database "Owned state\nactive NodeConfig and physical-service-window deadline" as State
queue "Input / output\nVersioned NodeConfig / physical action → atomic applied config or reason" as IO
API --> N04
IO --> N04
N04 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
N04 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "S03\nFirmware security/update" as S03
N04 ..> S03 : contract / port
component "H07\nHub lifecycle/config" as H07
N04 ..> H07 : contract / port
component "B06\nFleet/config" as B06
N04 ..> B06 : contract / port
note bottom of N04
Flow: Validate identity, location, enabled capability and heartbeat range; reject same/older version; replace active snapshot atomically.
Guard: No open radio enrollment. Invalid config leaves prior version intact. Service access expires by monotonic deadline.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
